    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564">

                <pb facs="0807" n="711" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg711"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr. Woodford.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Sunday,
                                Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-03-27"><hi rendition="#italic">March 27,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Believed the <hi rendition="#italic">Maine</hi> report will be held in Congress
                    for a short time without action. A feeling of deliberation prevails in both
                    houses of Congress. See if the following can be done: <list>
                        <item>First. Armistice until October 1. Negotiations meantime looking <pb
                                facs="0808" n="712" xml:id="pg712"/> for peace between Spain and
                            insurgents through friendly offices of President United States.</item>
                        <item>Second. Immediate revocation of reconcentrado order so as to permit
                            people to return to their farms, and the needy to be relieved with
                            provisions and supplies from United States cooperating with authorities
                            so as to afford full relief.</item>
                        <item>Add, if possible:</item>
                        <item>Third. If terms of peace not satisfactorily settled by October 1,
                            President of the United States to be final arbiter between Spain and
                            insurgents.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>If Spain agrees, President will use friendly offices to get insurgents to accept
                    plan. Prompt action desirable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
